# NarrativeNode — .gitattributes (public release)
#
# backend/scripts/mcp_catalogue.json is regenerated at runtime by the
# backend. Pin it to LF so a regeneration on any OS (Windows would
# otherwise write CRLF) stays byte-identical to the committed copy and
# never surfaces as a phantom local change that blocks `git pull`.
backend/scripts/mcp_catalogue.json text eol=lf
